e programs and solutions, including traditional Medicare and Medicare advantage and affordable care act to seniors and eligible individuals through a network of primarily independent contractor agents. The company was formerly known as BRP Group, Inc. and changed its name to The Baldwin Insurance Group, Inc. in May 2024. The Baldwin Insurance Group, Inc. was founded in 2011 and is headquartered in Tampa, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Trevor Lowry Baldwin | Co-Founder, CEO & Non-Independent Director | Age 39 | Compensation: $2.2M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 5K people. Revenue per employee of $301K ranks in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers, with revenue growing 11%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $14K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 7\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (4/10).","financial_summary":["The Baldwin Insurance Group, In is a mid-cap financial services business with a $4.5B market cap on $1.5B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +11% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at -6% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $69M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.6\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 2.5% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.2\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.4) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 24% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 130% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.300594957030881},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.9% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $4.6M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-4581377.98},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Baron Small Cap Fund Trimmed its Position in The Baldwin Insurance Group (BWIN) Following Take Private Deal","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/baron-small-cap-fund-trimmed-161541043.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794586541.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.382,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Baldwin Insurance Group (BWIN) Just Gave Investors Something To Think About","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/insurance/nasdaq-bwin/baldwin-insurance-group/news/baldwin-insurance-group-bwin-just-gave-inv